Two caveats you'll see in the journal: if the hunt landed no fights at all (`ended: 'nothing here'`, so no battle was ever held), `disengage` has nothing to break off and will come back `refused`/`failed` — harmless to the returned Outcome; and if the flight itself never reached the POI, `main` returns the *flight* Outcome (still a valid `Outcome`), and `disengage` then handles the empty-battle case.

